Stamping elbow is to use the same material with the pipe plate stamping die stamping into a half ring elbow, and then two half ring elbow group welding forming. Due to the different welding standards of all kinds of pipelines, semi-finished products are usually manufactured according to the group of point solid, and welding is carried out according to the grade of pipeline weld in field construction.
Before stamping, the tube blank is placed on the lower die, the inner core and end die are loaded into the tube blank, and the elbow is formed by the constraint of the outer die and the support of the inner die.
Stamping elbows are divided into cold stamping and hot stamping. Cold stamping or hot stamping is usually selected according to material properties and equipment capacity.
