(1) sheath material moisture content exceeds the standard. The polymer material for moisture content requirements are relatively strict, so in the injection molding production before the standard baking operation, the purpose is to make the material to meet a certain moisture content requirements, such as low moisture content will change the toughness of the material, enhance the probability of fracture.
3) Mismatch between injection molding machine model (displacement) and product. The injection molding machine with too large a displacement to produce smaller products will lead to the molten state of the material in the injection molding equipment for too long, resulting in the degradation of the material molecular chain, changing the characteristics of the material and reducing the performance of the material.
(5) The risk of fracture is also aggravated by the low toughness of the raw material itself. For example, PBT material due to its own low material toughness, it is more likely to fracture defects, so in the design of the connector pre-selection of materials, to fully consider the use of the product environment, select the appropriate material.
