Strong alkaline battery is a more balanced battery, which has been developed successfully in the United States and is currently in the experimental stage. It has almost zero environmental pollution and is degradable, so it is a truly environmentally friendly battery, but it is currently in the experimental stage and is only used in personal vehicles.
