Bad memories in past relationships it can cause the person to be a little reluctant when it comes to showing some affection or love towards their partner.
The lack of love or affection usually has a series of negative consequences for the good future of the couple:
There is a lack of communication within the couple that does not benefit it. Dialogue in the couple is essential so that it becomes stronger and lasts over time.
Both people adapt to this situation that does not benefit the aforementioned relationship at all. They accommodate and the couple does not evolve.
The first thing is to sit down, talk things out clearly and recognize that there is a crisis within the couple. As long as the parties are unable to recognize that there is a problem, the thing can become entrenched and lead to the end of the relationship.
Communication must be fluid and continuous in order to understand what each one has to say. The key to everything is to say what you think and listen to the other party.
