Therefore, if you are pregnant, you should know that sunbathing can be very beneficial. For you first, because you yourself suffer from the deficiency in your bones, since it is the baby that takes the nutrients you consume.
An hour's walk down the street would be enough, without even being necessary for the sun to hit you full. You should also protect the most sensitive areas such as the head, because a heat stroke starts there and can cause serious consequences.
The skin of the face is especially sensitive to hyperpigmentation in pregnancy, so you must use a specific product for this use. Only then can you safely sunbathe and still suffer the ravages of skin spots.
Prevent your body from overheating, you should not spend a lot of time lying in the sun either. It is preferable to do it while you are taking a walk, so that your legs and arms do not swell.
