How to make solid air freshener to perfume the house | Bezzia
To achieve this there are many homemade tricks, such as having fresh flowers, natural air fresheners for each room, cloth bags with dried flowers for the cabinets, among many other options. Like this idea to create solid air freshener that you can use both to perfume the house, as drawers or inside cabinets.
Table of Contents 1 Solid air freshener, how is it made?
Solid air freshener is nothing more than a kind of old-fashioned bar of soap, only instead of being used to wash clothes, it is used to aromatize the home or the cabinets. To create these smelly soaps or solid air freshener, you will need vegetable wax to create the solid material.
To create a solid homemade air freshener you will need to use soy wax, that is, it is a product in addition to being handmade, it is vegan. As for the ingredient used to achieve the perfume, you can opt for the essential oil in which case the amount to use will be 5% of the amount with respect to the wax.
