What are the requirements for getting married in the church?
If both you and your partner have decided marry religiously Under the precepts of the Catholic Church, there will be certain requirements that you will have to meet.
The main one is to go to your parish to find out what type of documents you must deliver before celebrating the wedding. Once you have met with the parish priest, you will have to take a premarital and gather the required documents for the opening of the matrimonial file.
1 Find out in your parish
3 Choose two witnesses for the taking of sayings
The first step is to go to the parish where you want to marry at least one year in advance to inform you of all the requirements and reserve the date for the link.
Face-to-face sessions are usually group sessions, meeting in them the different couples interested in getting married and the parish priest. They can be done in any parish and even online in the event that it is impossible for any of the members of the couple to attend in person.
They usually cost several sessions, so the ideal is to take the marriage course six months before the marriage so as not to stress more than you should when the date approaches. Choose two witnesses for the taking of sayings
Photocopy of DNI, passport or residence card of each of the members of the couple.
Baptismal of the two spouses. You must request it in the parish where you were baptized, providing your name, surname and year of baptism.
The Spanish State recognizes canonical marriage as legal, so you will not need to previously celebrate the marriage in the Civil Registry or in court. If you have, however, you should have your civil marriage certificate and a photocopy of it handy.
When a woman is pregnant and she is told that her baby will be a girl, it is like an "I don't know what" comes in that makes women go to shops and stores to look for beautiful outfits for your daughters. Dresses of flowers, of colors, of different textures… all are worth for the baby that is to arrive.
2 Dresses borrowed better than bought
4 Where to buy dresses for girls
You don't need so many dresses
Babies grow very fast and maybe what you buy for today will not come for next week. What's more, baby and children's clothing is not exactly very cheap So perhaps a couple of dresses with their accessories cost you more than 30 euros, which will become thrown away in a few weeks or months.
This way you can save money and also dress your daughters. Although if they leave your clothes as something borrowed, you must use them responsibly and take good care of them to be able to return them in the best possible condition (taking into account continued use).
When your daughter is a baby, it is usual for you to choose the clothes she wears so that she is well dressed and looks as beautiful as possible. Clothes, even if you think not, have a great impact on children's development since they help them to create a good body image of themselves, exactly as adults do.
In stores you can find: casual, modern, classic, traditional and even vintage styles. Choose the one that best suits your personality when she is your baby daughter and then the style that you think your daughter is forming ... so that it has its own personality also in clothes.
At this point you may be wondering which are the best trusted sites to buy dresses for girls and that it is not too expensive so that your pocket does not suffer too much. Do not lose detail!
En EbayYou can find a large number of dresses at very low prices for girls. Very competitive prices and they also send it to your home.
In Vertbaudet You can find a large collection of clothes for girls (also boys) so you will have many beautiful dresses to choose from. The prices may not be entirely cheap but it is worth investing, the service is great if you have any problems, returns are free, you have a huge catalog and also if you sign up you can receive offers periodically.
In the Mayoral store You know that the clothes you buy at Mayoral are good quality clothes and made with good materials. But if you decide to buy dresses for your daughter here you will have to prepare your pocket because you will not find anything that is too cheap.
En AmazonYou can find dresses for babies and girls, and even very funny costumes in dresses. The prices are competitive and you can find a great variety.
AliExpressIt is beginning to be a great competition for Amazon and it sells almost the same categories as Amazon and also has very competitive prices. If you want to find girls' dresses at competitive prices, you can also enter this website.
Zalandois a website where you can also find dresses for babies and children at competitive prices and also, you can find a wide variety of products so that you can choose the one that best suits your tastes and budget.
Kiabi is one of my favorite stores along with Leftiesto buy girl's or boy's clothes. They have very affordable prices and a fairly good variety that will help you to buy quality clothes at good prices and with a sufficient variety to satisfy your needs.
If you did not know the ones that I mention in this article, from now on you can start making a good purchase without damaging your pocket too much.
