By now we have all heard of gel nails, and many of you have probably tried them due to their popularity. Without a doubt they are a great alternative and there are many women who wear spectacular nails only thanks to this technique.
We say it because natural nail suffers before the application of these gel nails, and there are women who even need months to recover their nails. When polishing, the thickness of these decreases, so they become more brittle and become damaged.
Also, people who bite their nails can get long nails again, thanks to the hard gel extensions. That is why it is a good idea for those special occasions when we want to show off perfect and long nails.
