It consists of a telephone connection that can be classified according to a series of signs, but it is generally divided into two types: using software or a special telephone and communication using cards.
The quality of voice communication over the Internet depends on the passage of a digital signal, which carries data packets from one point to another. It is a technology that provides a fast, convenient and economical service.
The voice on the computer (or on the IP phone) is converted into a digital signal and transmitted to the other party's computer (IP phone). There, it is converted to an analog signal and played through the speaker.
The signal is transmitted digitally through the communication channel and, as a rule, it is converted (compressed) before transmission to remove excess information and reduce the load on the data transmission network.
In addition, there are no borders in terms of communication. The simplicity of the configuration and the level of security are two other great advantages that this technology has.
Unlimited data transmission. With IP telephony, you can organize audio conferences, send information in text and other formats.
Since Internet traffic does not have a geographic reference, the distance between the sending region and the information receiving region is also not important, in contrast to normal telephone communication, which operates on the principle of 'the further, the further. expensive".
