H.E Hou Samith, Secretary of State of MoWA, stated that this training contained many lessons related to the penal and civil codes, the Law on the Prevention of Domestic Violence and other procedures to help survivors. Therefore, much learning is required to grasp the relevant legal knowledge to support survivors.
